<title>HONG KONG: Baltrans interim net rises 45.66 pct.</title>
<headline>Baltrans interim net rises 45.66 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended January 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   11.2   vs 7.7</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    2.2    vs 2.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    26.68  vs 18.32</p>
